{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21107","headline":"和乐天感鹤 · 元稹","name":"和乐天感鹤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我有所爱鹤，毛羽霜雪妍。\n秋霄一滴露，声闻林外天。\n自随卫侯去，遂入大夫轩。\n云貌久已隔，玉音无复传。\n吟君感鹤操，不觉心惕然。\n无乃予所爱，误爲微物迁。\n因兹谕直质，未免柔细牵。\n君看孤松树，左右萝茑缠。\n既可习爲饱，亦可薰爲荃。\n期君常善救，勿令终弃捐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21107.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21107","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}